(text "SMA1 / SMA2: bidirectional 3.3 V LVCMOS (default input)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "162979f4-b0d0-5748-8c5c-494b9248ada8"))
(text "SMA1 -> FPGA LPLL2_T_in (pin 13): 10 MHz TTL reference from DOROGO\n        or trigger/PPS input; can also drive a trigger out.\nSMA2 -> FPGA GCLKT_3 (pin 63): PPS / trigger in or out.\n\nDIR = 0 (default, 10k pull-down): SMA -> FPGA. DIR = 1: FPGA -> SMA.\n33 Ohm series + buffer Rout ~ 50 Ohm source termination.\nJPx closed: 50 Ohm load for long coax inputs (keep open when driving).\nInput level: 3.3 V LVCMOS/TTL only; sine reference is not accepted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 228.6 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7dd43f36-6b31-5bb0-85a0-30e1a0ae2c29"))
